            0.087,
            0.881,
            0.13
          ],
          "content": "**2. Do you see any connection between each number and the corresponding smallest number of button clicks?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.138,
            0.883,
            0.181
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** The smallest number of buttons click for each number is the sum of its digit."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.2,
            0.229,
            0.219
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 8"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.23,
            0.719,
            0.249
          ],
          "content": "**How many zeros does a thousand lakh have?** <u>8 zeros</u>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.259,
            0.756,
            0.278
          ],
          "content": "？ **How many zeros does a hundred thousand have?** <u>5 zeros</u>"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.303,
            0.229,
            0.322
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 9"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.333,
            0.282,
            0.351
          ],
          "content": "? **Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.354,
            0.877,
            0.392
          ],
          "content": "**1. Read the numbers and write their number names in both the Indian and American systems:**"
